                  "text": "Why preventive habits (such as exercising regularly) are important in maintaining good health, and how the use of tobacco products, alcohol, and other harmful substances can negatively affect your personaparticle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-737b18b1 elementor-section-full_width elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"737b18b1\" data-element_type=\"section\" id=\"menu-mobile-container\" data-settings=\"{\"sticky\":\"top\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"sticky_on\":[\"tablet\",\"mobile\"],\"sticky_offset_tablet\":0,\"sticky_effects_offset_tablet\":0,\"sticky_offset\":0,\"sticky_effects_offset\":0,\"sticky_anchor_link_offset\":0}\"> My.scouting $(\"#search-nav\").on(\"click\", function(event ){ $(\"#search-nav\").addClass(\"btn-secondary\"); $(\".nav-search-input\").css(\"visibility\", \"visible\"); }); Awards Central",
